physicalRef: ownership_links
description: "Beneficial-ownership and sanctions Link Analysis showcase - ONE link Dataset built by the ownership_links Job from company, person, ownership, officer, customer, payment and sanctions_list. kind is one of owns, officer_of, customer_is, paid, name_match; one row per pair; percent is the stake (owns), score the name similarity (name_match), amount the payments summed (paid); via names the evidence. Ids say what an endpoint is: PER- person, CO- company, CUS- bank customer, SL- entry on the invented sanctions list. Synthetic."
eventDate: event_date
